        Set VariableSet NPC_VarPoint = (Position of NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp)
        Set VariableSet NPC_VarUnitGroup = (Units within 600.00 of NPC_VarPoint matching ((((Matching unit) is alive) Equal to True) and (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of (Owner of NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp).) Equal to True)).)
        -------- =================================== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
            Then - Actions
