                -------- FIREBOLT --------
                Unit - Order NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp to Neutral - Firebolt (Random unit from NPC_VarUnitGroup)
                -------- =================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_NPC_VarUnitGroup)
